Package: dlprw
Type: Package
Title: Permutation-Averaged Redundancy Weighting for Composite Indicators
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Eduardo", "Jiménez-Fernández", email = "edjimfer@ugr.es",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes composite indicators using weighted lattice norms
    and permutation-averaged linear redundancy corrections inspired by
    the DP2 methodology. Supports exact subset averaging, polarity-based
    normalization, multiple norm parameters, and ordinal comparisons.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: stats, utils
NeedsCompilation: no
